type: software
title: "End-to-End Learning for Autonomous Driving"
abstract: >-
  Research software for multimodal camera-LiDAR perception, spatial feature
  extraction with Xception and ResNeXt-50, temporal LSTM-attention modeling,
  and joint steering-angle and vehicle-speed prediction.
